   "body": "The fixed code does not move plain DreamerV3: 4.77 against 4.63, well inside the noise of a 30-world score (about ±0.55 between world sets; a gap under ~1.1 between single runs is not evidence). Both stay at the wood tier: no stone is collected in any episode, and lifespans (265-295 steps) sit near the random-policy band (261-284)."
  },
